",{text:"JINX",bold:true,italic:false,color:gold,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",["",{text:"Widow",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red},{text:"/\n   ",italic:false,color:dark_red},{text:"Damsel",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue}],{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"If the Widow is (or has been) in play, the Damsel is poisoned."],["","      ",{text:"JINX",bold:true,italic:false,color:gold,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",["",{text:"Vizier",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red},{text:"/\n   ",italic:false,color:dark_red},{text:"Alsaahir",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue}],{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"The Storyteller doesn't declare the Vizier is in play."],["","      ",{text:"JINX",bold:true,italic:false,color:gold,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",["",{text:"Lil' Monsta",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red},{text:"/\n   ",italic:false,color:dark_red},{text:"Magician",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue}],{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"If the Magician is alive, the Storyteller chooses which Minion babysits Lil' Monsta. "],["","      ",{text:"JINX",bold:true,italic:false,color:gold,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",["",{text:"Lil' Monsta",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red},{text:"/\n   ",italic:false,color:dark_red},{text:"Vizier",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red}],{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_red},"If the Vizier is babysitting Lil' Monsta, they die when executed."],["","      ",{text:"JINX",bold:true,italic:false,color:gold,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",["",{text:"Fairy Godmother",italic:false,underlined:true,color:gray},{text:"/\n   ",italic:false,color:gray},{text:"Damsel",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_blue}],{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_blue},"If the Fairy Godmother causes a new Damsel to be in play, Minions & the Hunter learn about the new Damsel."],["","      ",{text:"JINX",bold:true,italic:false,color:gold,click_event:{action:change_page,page:2}},"\n\n",["",{text:"Fairy Godmother",italic:false,underlined:true,color:gray},{text:"/\n   ",italic:false,color:gray},{text:"Lil' Monsta",italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_red}],{text:":\n",italic:false,color:dark_red},"If the Demon becomes a non-Demon role, a Lil' Monsta is created. Lil' Monsta will vanish at dusk. If Lil' Monsta's babysitter becomes a Demon, Lil' Monsta will vanish until dusk."]],title:"",author:""},custom_name={text:"A Grimme Fairytale Script",bold:true,italic:false,underlined:true,color:dark_gray},lore=[{text:"Useful role cheat sheet for ",italic:false,color:gray},[{text:"A Grimme Fairytale",italic:false,color:dark_gray},{text:" script.",italic:false,color:gray}]]]